    /// Tasks would then be dealt with in subsequent planning steps/iterations. With this definition, an
    /// "unchangeable" allocation item is "System/vehicle constrained" and therefore the new *Plan being
    /// developed should avoid changes that would cause the item to be unallocated. A stricter
